  "inventoryNote": "All nine original .any.js files and their thirteen non-HTTP/2 variants are selected. Fixtures and support match one pinned WPT revision byte-for-byte. Eight HTTP/2 variants are excluded. Ten registrations with elapsed-time or fixed-size pending-write assumptions remain named blocks; deterministic package controls cover their ordering separately. The other 97 registrations, including the independent GC-only test, run unchanged.",
